  (54, 'Elecampane', 'Inula helenium', 'Root', 'β-Sitosterol', 'Sterol', 'Phytosterol', 'Moderate', 'Present', 'Supports anti-inflammatory activity and complements the root''s phytosterol fraction.', NULL),
