  (124, 'Ginger', 'Zingiber officinale', 'Rhizome', 'Zingerone', 'Phenylpropanoid', 'Phenolic ketone', 'Moderate', 'Present', 'Formed from gingerols during heating; contributes digestive and antioxidant activity with less pungency.', NULL),
